taurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","review_id":"8M6hNmcx5P7wGcGNnRmk1w","date":"2017-08-16T16:18:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9251229166984558,"text_excerpt":"Just moved from California and have been looking for somewhere in the city that serves HEALTHY food at a REASONABLE PRICE! Good God, it's tough. FYI, produce and healthy options in Nola cost MORE than in California--it's ridiculous. However, Vintage Garden is a great little spot for breakfast or lunch. I had the breakfast burrito (3 egg) and it was delicious. Not greasy and not stuffed with flavorless potatoes. Will be back again for sure...just wish it was open on the weekends!"},{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","review_id":"NntGhoe0DdfXOvOd_OHLFw","date":"2019-01-23T20:49:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9169085025787354,"text_excerpt":"First time here and was not disappointed. A quaint little place just off Prytania in uptown. Was greeted at the door by very friendly faces behind the counter. Had questions about the menu and they were very helpful. I chose the Roasted Cauliflower Curry soup with a chicken pesto panini. Perfect for a miserable rainy day like today. The soup was simply delicious and the house made panini bread made the sandwich. Bring a friend when you order it. Definitely enough for 2. They also preserve their soups so you can stop by and pick up a jar to take home for dinner. I bought the Fiery Shiitake Mushroom & Barley for tonight. 14$ for a mason jar size. Plenty for two. Will be returning soon to tr..."},{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","review_id":"V9HZc2O671EUqnX40BrTQA","date":"2021-04-25T18:44:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9165512323379517,"text_excerpt":"One day I was just craving a salad and ended up at Vintage Garden Kitchen. Currently, they are serving meals from a window outside so you can't physically go in and sit in the restaurant. I ordered a chicken Caesar salad and it was amazing. The salad was so large I was able to split it and the cost was beyond reasonable. I also ordered the chicken pesto sandwich which was tasty, served on ciabatta bread! My favorite for a panini. Overall, it was a great experience, the service was a little off, the lady seemed overwhelmed but I understand it was lunch hour."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","photo_id":"WNqf3PDby7cihqpkhCdJWg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/WNqf3PDby7cihqpkhCdJWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9064427018165588},{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","photo_id":"Zv_yrSswwOu28Wzv4mtPMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Zv_yrSswwOu28Wzv4mtPMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8774882555007935},{"business_id":"CIVPalBUxIRUJ04ig5NTFw","photo_id":"3c7T7JAJFTQpQUdjuv4u8g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3c7T7JAJFTQpQUdjuv4u8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.848006546497345}]},"notebook_case":null}
